[gd_scene format=3]

; The Belfry, the bell loft over the Drowned Hall (map offset (15, 32)): reached up the hall's metal shaft,
; through a hole in the loft floor; dropping back down the hole is free. A dead end that rewards the climb:
; a pilgrim shrine, a Lamplighter, and a great bell hanging in its frame against tall openings onto the
; skyline. Steps lead up to a lookout under the bell.

